      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There needs to be a way to emulate the Quest client on PC so creators have a way to test on that platform without having to fork over money to buy one of Metas headsets.  Until that happens, or I can find one  cheap or free, Quest development for me is on the backburner.  If there was an APK available of the VRC client available for download perhaps it could be possible to emulate it on something like bluestacks.",
